OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mixture of 
OL,6,Fcloud and clear spells for most        
OL,7,Ftonight, with temperatures falling     
OL,8,Faway sharply where skies clear leading 
OL,9,Fto a patchy frost by dawn. In the      
OL,10,Fnortheast, showers feed through,       
OL,11,Fwintry over hills. Feeling chilly in   
OL,12,Fan easterly breeze.                    
OL,14,CThursday:FIt will be cloudy and dry    
OL,15,Ffor most on Thursday, while still      
OL,16,Ffeeling cold with temperatures below   
OL,17,Faverage. Heavy rain and strong winds   
OL,18,Farrive in northwestern areas in the    
OL,19,Fafternoon.                             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
